Brand tone by situation
title end

paragraph start
Tone is the voice adjusted to the moment. List the situations the brand meets: a new post, praise, criticism, a correction, a sponsored post and news coverage. Write one line of tone for each.
paragraph end

paragraph start
News coverage and corrections need the plainest tone, because accuracy matters more than style there. Sponsored posts need clear disclosure wording from the legal and finance pages.
paragraph end

